            <div class="text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.95)]" ani-fade-in="">165 帧游戏都能满帧畅玩，</div>
            <div class="flex items-center" ani-fade-in="">
              <div class="text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.95)]">其它主流游戏帧率更是</div>
