                      <p ani-fade-in="" class="mot:text-16px mot:font-medium mot:leading-[1.4] mo:w-full mo:text-[#2a2a2a] mo:opacity-55 mo:mt-8px"> 启动动画秒加载！跳过漫长等待，一键直达游戏战场。</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-container mx-auto relative z-2 mo:w-[328rpx] mo: mo:mt-[24rpx] mo:flex mo:items-center mo:justify-between">
              <div class="progress overflow-hidden relative mo:w-[212rpx] mo:h-[2px] mo: mo:rounded-[1rpx] mo:bg-[#CAC6C9]">
                <div class="slider w-full h-full bg-[#000000] rounded-[2rpx] absolute top-0 left-0" style="transform-origin: left center;"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="mo:w-80rpx mo: mo:flex">
                <div class="button-prev mo:w-32rpx mo:h-32rpx" style="transform: rotate(180deg);"><img data-src-360="/content/dam/oneplus/2025/product-station/macan/assets/images-carousel-next-1-5e07ad.svg.webp" class="mo: mo:w-full mo:h-full"></div>
                <div class="button-next mo:w-32rpx mo:h-32rpx mo:ml-12rpx"><img data-src-360="/content/dam/oneplus/2025/product-station/macan/assets/images-carousel-next-1-5e07ad.svg.webp" class="mo: mo:w-full mo:h-full"></div>
